Maintainer: Twilight <twilight@aliveos.org>
Depends: python, git
Section: video
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp
Description: Video/audio downloader, git master snapshot
 yt-dlp installed straight from upstream master, so site extractors
 are days (not months) old. Reinstall/upgrade the package to pull the
 latest fixes. Pair with curl-cffi for --impersonate support.
